) Request Details: Please draw a joyful, high-energy \"Water Gun War\" scene at the Summer Music Festival featuring Yu and Ayumu as a close duo! The Scene: * Yu and Ayumu are tightly holding hands while charging forward together across a bright outdoor festival stage. * With their free hands, they are holding matching water gun rifles (水鉄砲ライフル) and aiming them forward playfully, like a synchronized 2-player team. * Yu looks incredibly excited and full of \"Tokimeki,\" while Ayumu looks determined and happily protective of her. Costume: Both girls are wearing the official \"Summer on Stage!!\" (サマー・オン・ステージ！！) dress. Please design Yu’s version to match Ayumu’s perfectly. Atmosphere: The setting is a bright, sunny outdoor festival stage with dynamic water splashes all around them. Please highlight their strong, inseparable childhood friend bond and can add the same background as summer festival music like this one https://jmp.sh/ApX1hQ8n References: [Yuu and ayumu in the same dress as this https://jmp.sh/ApX1hQ8n ] Thank you!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hanawaamu/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1414829, "client_id": 3743192, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8adf7fcc/uploads/origins/98d5c2a9-2c99-498a-9578-64dd21aec407?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aca47acbbd833bfc5934057970883e37", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8adf7fcc/uploads/origins/98d5c2a9-2c99-498a-9578-64dd21aec407?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aca47acbbd833bfc5934057970883e37, https://si.imgix.net/8adf7fcc/uploads/origins/98d5c2a9-2c99-498a-9578-64dd21aec407?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2306ff361f6b01296488d631248c62b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8adf7fcc/uploads/origins/98d5c2a9-2c99-4